{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20770","headline":"冬行三首 一 · 卢仝","name":"冬行三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虫豸腊月皆在蛰，吾独何乃劳其形。\n小大无由知天命，但怪守道不得宁。\n老母妻子一挥手，涕下便作千里行。\n自顾不及遭霜叶，旦夕保得同飘零。\n达生何足云，偶然苦乐经其身。\n古来尧孔与桀跖，善恶何补如今人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}